# story

## Intent
Own the Pi-free Hydra Storybook policy and browser/index service seams.

## Contract
Expose typed Storybook index, portless URL, and render services plus the deterministic list/show action core.

## Behaviour
The core matches component stories, selects an optional story, builds preview-iframe URLs, forwards viewport options, and returns captures with console errors.

## Edge cases
Empty component results and unknown story selectors fail with typed index errors. Portless and browser failures remain typed and do not leak Pi APIs.

## Non-goals
This library does not register Pi tools, import Pi, start Storybook, or provide a generic browser wrapper.

## Evidence
The colocated core tests use fake services to cover lookup, empty results, URL options, preview targeting, and render errors.
